   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Mr. ___ is a ___ year old, right handed gentleman with \na\nhistory of atrial fibrillation, low back pain, ruptured disk,\nspinal stenosis, right sciatica and chronic right leg weakness,\nwho presents with new onset dysarthria and increased weakness in\nhis right extremities.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=370-641",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "According to the patient's wife, the patient was feeling more\ntired than usual last week and at 6:45 am, today, he stumbled as\nhe was trying to get out of bed and fell back into the bed.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=644-830",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Later\nin the morning, when he went out to the driveway to pick up the\nnewspaper, he had to use an umbrella as a cane.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=832-949",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He was unable to\nwalk back into the house without assistance due to being unable\nto lift the right leg.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=950-1053",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He had to use his arms on the door frame\nto pull himself forward.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=1054-1119",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "His wife noted that he seem to have\ntrouble picking up with right leg.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=1120-1190",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He could not pick his leg up\nbecause he felt that it was weak but not because he is in pain.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=1191-1283",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Upon examining the patient, his wife noticed no facial drooping.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=1285-1349",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She asked him to lift his arms up and he was able to.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=1350-1403",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HPI:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HPI",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She did \nnot\ntest pronator drift.",
