   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On presentation he was noted to \nhave labial dysarthria, mild right face/arm/leg\nweakness, possible dysmetria in the right.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=6794-6917",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On MRI that patient \nhas a lacunar infarct in the left internal capsule which \nlocalizes well with his symptoms.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=6918-7030",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Likely etiology of his stroke \nis small vessel disease given its location and appearance \nhowever cardio-embolic disease is also possible given his afib.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=7031-7184",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient presented on apixaban and was transitioned to \ncoumadin (via conversations with his out patient cardiologist \nand family) He will be bridged with lovenox.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=7186-7352",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "His ECHO did not \nshow any evidence of shunt or intra-cardiac thrombus.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=11081904-DS-16:chars=7353-7424",
   "needs": []
